    "failureBehavior": "Keeps the last known bytes and marks the sample incomplete.",
    "dataHandling": "Existing scanners remain read-only, allowlisted, bounded by entry/depth/time limits, and do not read file contents or remove data.",
    "scopeLimits": [
      "This moves directory enumeration only; point reads of memory and usable storage remain in device telemetry sampling.",
      "No per-feature VOD or torrent cache limits are changed or clamped by this increment.",
